      "message": "Wdyt about having these be structs with functions to get the snippet ID and data. Then add a \n \n   template\u003cBlock\u003e SkPaintParamsKey::add(Block\u0026 b);\n   \nto the key, which should also let you hide a lot of the byte manipulation functions from the public interface of the key.",
